        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "is this Draft? ci failing. \r\n\r\nthis will require some careful thought, so may be awhile before it's reviewed. ideally we should get feedback from @bfredl and GUI client authors.\r\n\r\nmy first question is whether any of these new UI events overlap with UI events that we gained since https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/8707 . and also, should any of them be combined or is the granularity more ergonomic/useful?\r\n\r\nto increase the chances of review , keep the PR rebased regularly, even if there's no feedback for weeks or months. This is a gesture that increases our confidence that this isn't a drive-by contribution without an owner.\r\n",
