        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Oh right, I haven't thought about the `external` flag like that, thats a good point. Some time ago (read years) I played around with the idea of gnvim being in complete control of the window management and came to the conclusion that its not possible at the moment. Maybe I need to revisit that idea and have another look at the external flag.\r\n\r\nBut yeah, it would eventually diverge the GUIs between themselves and the TUI.",
